<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Lai Sun group suspended - HK exchange.</title>
<headline>Trading in Lai Sun group suspended - HK exchange.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Lai Sun group of companies was suspended at the companies' own request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trading in the shares of parent company Lai Sun International Ltd, Lai Sun Development Co Ltd and Lai Sun Hotels International Ltd were all suspended, the exchange announcement said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6933  http://www.hk97.com</p>
